 nd new onsite members receive a complimentary Him Mark Lai biography and a
 ll visitors receive 10% off gift shop purchases. FREE ADMISSION DAY Saturd
 ay\, November 21\, 2026 | 10A-5P Celebrating CHSA Museum’s 25th annivers
 ary at 965 Clay Street.
